、李元、李刚等九侯坐与宋娥更相赂遗，求高官增邑，并遣就国，减租四分之一。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4375,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"969a849d-db0e-11ef-8d0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"廣中","place_name_jianti_auto":"广中","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"969a84b8-db0e-11ef-bf26-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長沙","place_name_jianti_auto":"长沙","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"969a84b9-db0e-11ef-adfb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"區，烏侯翻；今廣中猶有此姓。姓譜云：今長沙有此姓，音豈俱翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"区，乌侯翻；今广中犹有此姓。姓谱云：今长沙有此姓，音岂俱翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"969a84b7-db0e-11ef-9730-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"長吏","official_note":"長吏在汉代通常指地方官员，如县令、县长等，负责管理县级行政事务。在上下文中，象林蛮区怜等攻击县寺并杀死长吏，表明长吏是地方行政体系中的关键职位，负责维护地方秩序。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"殺長吏","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"5e338117-0cc3-4ec1-b803-6776aa041b9a"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"交趾刺史","official_note":"交趾刺史是东汉时期交趾郡（今越南北部）的地方行政长官，负责管理该地区的政务和军事。在上下文中，交趾刺史樊演调动军队救援象林蛮区怜攻击的县寺，体现了其作为地方长官的军事指挥和应急职责。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"交趾刺史樊演發交趾、九眞兵萬餘人救之","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"78b61ca2-96bc-40c7-8a99-40e6716eaff8"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"区连是占婆第一王朝的建立者，原为东汉象林县功曹，137年率占族起兵，杀县令，自称林邑王。","link_td_id":"Q10010553","link_td_number_id":1080667,"people_name":"區憐","people_name_jianti_auto":"区怜","people_xingming":"区怜","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"969a84bb-db0e-11ef-bdf7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"樊演","people_name_jianti_auto":"樊演","people_xingming":"樊演","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"969a84bd-db0e-11ef-a322-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"象林","place_name_jianti_auto":"象林","resolved_place_entity_id":5315,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"969a84bc-db0e-11ef-8b1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"交趾","place_name_jianti_auto":"交趾","resolved_place_entity_id":579,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"969a84be-db0e-11ef-bb8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"交趾","place_name_jianti_auto":"交趾","resolved_place_entity_id":579,"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"969a84bf-db0e-11ef-b87e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九眞","place_name_jianti_auto":"九真","resolved_place_entity_id":1017,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"969a84c0-db0e-11ef-a41d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"7象林蠻區憐等攻縣寺，殺長吏。交趾刺史樊演發交趾、九眞兵萬餘人救之；兵士憚遠役，秋，七月，二郡兵反，攻其府。府雖擊破反者，而蠻勢轉盛。","content_fanyi":"象林县蛮人首领区怜等人攻打县衙，杀死地方官吏。交趾刺史樊演征发交趾、九真两郡士兵一万余人前往救援；士兵畏惧远途征役，秋季七月，两郡士兵反叛，攻打郡府。郡府虽然击破了反叛的士兵，但蛮人的势力反而更加强盛。","content_jianti_auto":"7象林蛮区怜等攻县寺，杀长吏。交趾刺史樊演发交趾、九真兵万余人救之；兵士惮远役，秋，七月，二郡兵反，攻其府。府虽击破反者，而蛮势转盛。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4376,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"969a84b6-db0e-11ef-9490-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969a84c3-db0e-11ef-93f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"東都諸儒以七緯爲內學，六經爲外學。","note_content_jianti_auto":"东都诸儒以七纬为内学，六经为外学。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"969a