_fanyi":"冬季，十月初十日甲申，汉顺帝巡幸长安。扶风人田弱举荐同郡人法真，说他博通儒家内学（指纬书）和外学（指六经），隐居不肯出仕，应当直接加授三公之职。顺帝虚心想要征召他，前后四次征召，法真始终不肯屈从。友人郭正称赞他说：“法真的名字可以听到，却很难见到他本人。他逃避名声，名声却随着他；他躲避名声，名声却追赶他，真可以说是百世之师了！”法真，是法雄的儿子。","content_jianti_auto":"8冬，十月，甲申，上行幸长安。扶风田弱荐同郡法真博通内、外学，隐居不仕，宜就加衮职。帝虚心欲致之，前后四征，终不屈。友人郭正称之曰：「法真名可得闻，身难得而见。逃名而名我随，避名而名我追，可谓百世之师者矣！」真，雄之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4377,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"969a84c1-db0e-11ef-a72e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"969a84d5-db0e-11ef-94b2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"9丁卯，京師地震。","content_fanyi":"丁卯日，京城洛阳发生地震。","content_jianti_auto":"9丁卯，京师地震。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4378,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"969a84d4-db0e-11ef-8c00-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否上奏诛杀专权宦官","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_969A84D6DB0E11EF848EA0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":13,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"楊震事見五十卷安帝延光三年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"961b8efa-db0e-11ef-92ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"楊震","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨震","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"969a84d8-db0e-11ef-b826-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"安帝","sta